text = "controls: wasd to move, 
space to attack, 
go through the pothole for 
the next part with q, 
refill your light at near 
by vending mechines with e, go 
near trashcans for hearts, go 
near fire hydrants to open exit! (pss 
look for the yellow stop sign 
for the exit!)
levels/achivements 
will NOT work on mobile!"

